<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Resolver Assigned to Your Request</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .highlight {
        color: #1d4ed8;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .request-details {
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 16px;
        background: #f0f9ff;
        border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .request-details p {
        margin: 8px 0;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .request-details strong {
        color: #0369a1;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Resolver Assigned to Your Request</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>
        Great news! A resolver has been assigned to your request and will be
        working on it shortly.
      </p>
      <div class="request-details">
        <p><strong>Request Number:</strong> <%= requestNumber %></p>
        <p><strong>Title:</strong> <%= requestTitle %></p>
        <p><strong>Assigned Resolver:</strong> <%= resolverName %></p>
      </div>
      <p>
        You can track the progress of your request from your dashboard. The
        resolver will update the status as they work on it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Best regards,<br />
        <span class="highlight">City Sense Team</span>
      </p>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= year %> City Sense. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
